  + [origin] is post-P4 readiness after whole-field planning and packetization acceptance
  + [purpose] is convert accepted P2 schema fixture oracles, P3 operator trace fixture oracles, P4 packet trace fixture oracles, IR7 operations dry-run proof packs, and IR8 manager proof packs into dependency-closed P8 final slices
  + [reason] is P8 is ready for deeper-reasoning slice minting, but the system must define fixture path policy, generated-output nonpromotion, proof ledger boundaries, stale and false-ready fault cases, and no-live-effect evaluation gates before fixture material, LangGraph runtime, surface projection, or operations-adjacent work consumes fixture authority

  = must: preserve fixture plans as reviewable obligations, not fixture source files, expected ledgers, generated outputs, runtime tests, dispatches, or live effects
  = must: preserve P2 authority overlays, P3 operator nonautomation boundaries, and P4 packet no-assignment no-dispatch no-live-effect boundaries
