  = should: make bounded fixture material creation GPT-5.3-Codex-Spark-suitable only after P8 implementation activation accepts file paths, expected ledgers, generated output nonpromotion, and no-live-effect proof boundaries

& [RequiredP8SliceFamilySet] is the source-level slice family set for P8
